Package: wassersteinStats
Title: Optimal Transport and Frechet Means in Wasserstein Space
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Seonguk",
           family = "Choi",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "seonguk.choi.stat@gmail.com")
Description: Computes Wasserstein distances, optimal transport maps, and
    Frechet means (barycenters) of probability distributions in one and two
    dimensions, together with the exponential and logarithmic maps of
    one-dimensional Wasserstein space. Includes an interactive Shiny
    application for exploring these objects.
